red unreliable\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Place of birth (i.e., the 50 states, DC, and outside the United States) was analyzed for 1993 through 1997.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}